{"updated":"2026-11-03T18:33:29.483Z","text":"Good evening, sir. Over the last twenty-four hours, the story leading the world is this: Greenland parliament approves security deal with US, Denmark. Elsewhere, seven flights across Europe targeted by suspected bomb threats. And france's dermatology crisis: Patients desperate for appointments. All of which keeps the conflict picture centred on Ukraine, at active conflict levels, though US, and Israel are worth keeping an eye on as well. The markets, for their part, felt the weight of it — the S&P 500 down 1.7 percent, the Dow Jones Industrial up 1.4 percent, and the Nasdaq Composite down 6.4 percent. The earth itself has been busier, with 39 tremors above magnitude two and a half — the strongest a 5.4 near 24 km NNW of Rioblanco, Colombia. And overhead, space weather is calm — nothing of concern. That is the shape of the day, sir. The board is yours.","times":[0,0.12,0.16,0.21,0.24,0.3,0.35,0.4,0.43,0.48,0.52,0.56,0.59,0.63,0.65,0.7,0.82,0.92,1.07,1.39,1.51,1.56,1.59,1.61,1.67,1.7,1.72,1.74,1.8,1.85,1.93,1.99,2.03,2.07,2.1,2.15,2.18,2.22,2.28,2.32,2.37,2.4,2.45,2.5,2.54,2.6,2.65,2.71,2.77,2.84,2.96,3.05,3.2,3.23,3.27,3.31,3.35,3.4,3.46,3.55,3.63,3.69,3.76,3.81,3.85,3.9,3.95,3.99,4.02,4.04,4.09,4.11,4.13,4.16,4.2,4.25,4.33,4.39,4.47,4.56,4.63,4.75,4.79,4.85,4.88,4.95,5.06,5.21,5.39,5.9,5.97,6.01,6.07,6.12,6.18,6.22,6.28,6.3,6.34,6.41,6.47,6.53,6.58,6.62,6.66,6.7,6.75,6.79,6.83,6.91,6.99,7.08,7.14,7.2,7.26,7.34,7.4,7.44,7.46,7.5,7.55,7.62,7.7,7.77,7.83,7.88,7.95,8,8.06,8.09,8.19,8.26,8.34,8.41,8.45,8.5,8.53,8.57,8.63,8.8,9.08,9.16,9.28,9.35,9.46,9.53,9.6,9.68,9.75,9.87,10.02,10.34,10.46,10.52,10.58,10.63,10.67,10.72,10.75,10.81,10.93,10.95,11.08,11.16,11.25,11.31,11.38,11.41,11.49,11.54,11.6,11.64,11.68,11.71,11.76,11.81,11.84,11.9,11.95,11.99,12.03,12.09,12.14,12.2,12.27,12.34,12.39,12.45,12.48,12.6,12.71,12.83,12.9,12.95,13,13.06,13.12,13.18,13.2,13.25,13.3,13.36,13.44,13.5,13.56,13.64,13.71,13.78,13.83,13.9,13.97,13.99